{
  "sequence_id": "seq_5f407d0064bb4a43",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Lord Shiono agreed to assume the family's debt."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The master of this house, Lord Yoshiaki, is a good man,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "But he's not very competent at managing finances."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Rumor has it that his wife, Lady Mizue, keeps him on a tight leash, too."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "with Lord Yoshikuni being the way he is..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's no great wonder that the old master would choose the younger brother, Lord Yoshiaki, as his heir, but..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Miss Sato will yell at me again if I keep going on like this."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "To repay you for the chat,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'll show you..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Something nice."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "OH! What is it, what is it?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I can't wait!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "PSX: Click"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "SFX: Third"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "!!"
    }
